iders, etc."}]}],"type":"step","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can get it at "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]},{"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-2.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icon finder"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is also available there to get icons for your projects."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Go to the website and learn things at "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-3.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS provides also a wiki attached to its GitHub repository. The wiki is a public base of knowledge with plenty of things: available API, technicala architecture, tips about processes, tests, conventions and toolings."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Have a look "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki"},{"type":"text","text":" to discover how OUDS works."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-4.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For technical reasons the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios"},{"type":"text","text":" GitHub repository does not embed the source code of the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"design system toolbox"}]},{"type":"text","text":" app. In fact this app and all its snapshots for tests increases a lot the size of the repository."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To get the source code of this showcase app, go to its dedicated GitHub repository at "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-5.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is open source, public and uses GitHub as forge. Thus, you will find common things inside the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios"},{"type":"text","text":" GitHub repository."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not hesitate to "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/issues"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/discussions"},{"type":"text","text":"!"}]}]}],"anchor":"More-resources","contentSection":[{"mediaPosition":"trailing","kind":"contentAndMedia","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode can use the Swift DocC documentation of OUDS, and this documentation is used to build a static web site."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"But there are also other resources which can be useful for you."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further"]}],"metadata":{"categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","title":"Going further with more resources","category":"Orange Unified